# hair/adult/topknot: Topknot: the hair drawn tight and sleek up to a knot on the crown, tied with a dark band; the ears clear
# P2b wave 2, HAIR. On the adult head box (STYLE_P2 21; man and woman). The knot bounces: topknot_tuft. Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult
role hair topknot
layer hairFront
anchor head
keys rest

